    card title "Whales killed in the 20th century?"

In the twentieth century, how many whales did people kill?
    draw whale count

    ask "Click on the line where you think it is." on count store w default "200000" relative true tolerance 0.3
        right: In the right range: nearly three million whales.
        wrong: Not quite. It was nearly three million.

Spread over the century, th (@draw per_day@)at is about eighty whales a day, every day, for a hundred years.

At the peak, in 1964, it was ei (@draw peak@)ghty-two thousand in a single year: one whale every six or seven minutes.

    erase whale per_day peak count

The worst hit was the blue whale, the largest animal that has ever lived. Before industrial whaling there were about three hundred and forty thousand.
    group herd members ["bw0","bw1","bw2","bw3","bw4","bw5","bw6","bw7","bw8","bw9","bw10","bw11","bw12","bw13","bw14","bw15","bw16","bw17","bw18","bw19","bw20","bw21","bw22","bw23","bw24","bw25","bw26","bw27","bw28","bw29","bw30","bw31","bw32","bw33","bw34","bw35","bw36","bw37","bw38","bw39","bw40","bw41","bw42","bw43","bw44","bw45","bw46","bw47","bw48","bw49","bw50","bw51","bw52","bw53","bw54","bw55","bw56","bw57","bw58","bw59","bw60","bw61","bw62","bw63","bw64","bw65","bw66","bw67","bw68","bw69"]
    text l340 "340,000 blue whales" #2f6b8f cites ["owid_whaling"] x 500 y 615 font_size 52

    erase l340

Hunters killed about three hundred and eighty thousand of them: more than were ever alive at one time.
    text k380 "380,000 killed" #b5482e cites ["owid_whale"] x 500 y 615 font_size 52

By 2001, of every seventy blue whales, one was left.
    fade gone to 0.12 duration 3

    erase k380

About five thousand, in all the world's oceans.
    text l5k "≈ 5,000 left" #b5482e cites ["owid_whaling"] x 500 y 615 font_size 52

    erase l5k

Then, in the 1980s, a worldwide ban on commercial whaling took hold.
    text ban "1980s: whaling ban" #5e584e x 500 y 615 font_size 52

    erase ban

By the 2010s, the whole catch, of every kind of whale, was about fifteen hundred a year: a fiftieth of the peak.
    text now "2010s: ≈ 1,500 whales a year" #2f6b8f cites ["owid_whale"] x 500 y 615 font_size 48

So the great hunt is almost over. But a blue whale is still a rare sight: one where seventy once swam.
    highlight bw0 effect circle

